		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Platter-sized blisters of acidic, blood-colored fluid that spontaneously manifest near magical wastes. Spread blood plague.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 7, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam (1 + plague), <strong>MV</strong> close (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> -3, <strong>D</strong> -3, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Burst</strong>. When reduced to 0 HP, explodes. All within close, DEX 12+ or 1d6 damage and plague.</p><p></p><p><strong>Plague</strong>. Scabby boils. CON 12+ or 1d6 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
